  "body": [
    "Reply combines learning, consulting, and change management to deliver real adoption, tangible business impact, and Responsible AI",
    "Overview",
    "Access to AI capabilities does not automatically translate into business value. Organisations need a structured way to enable people, activate the right behaviours, embed trust and governance, and measure what truly changes in day-to-day work and decision-making.",
    "Reply combines learning, consulting, and change enablement into one outcome-driven model. The focus is not training for its own sake, but real adoption, measurable impact, sustainable behaviour change, and a clear path from the first use of Copilot to enterprise AI Maturity.",
    "OUR APPROACH",
    "Our approach is designed to accelerate adoption without losing control. It aligns business priorities, role-based learning, governance requirements, and rollout mechanics so that AI can move from early experimentation to repeatable enterprise value.",
    "Equip business users, leaders, and IT teams with learning journeys that reflect how they work, decide, and govern.",
    "Embed Responsible AI, data awareness, and practical governance guardrails from day one to support secure and confident usage.",
    "Coordinate multi-country delivery through harmonised content, shared pedagogy, and unified reporting across cohorts and regions.",
    "We deliver instructor-led and blended programmes adapted to each customer context, helping organisations build the skills, confidence, and governance awareness needed to unlock value from Copilot and adjacent AI capabilities.",
    "Role-based learning for users, power users, and leaders focused on real work scenarios, daily productivity, and better decisions.",
    "Behaviour-focused learning and activation paths that move people from curiosity to confident, repeatable usage at scale.",
    "Prepare teams to extend Copilot into more advanced enterprise scenarios leveraging workflows, automation, and agents.",
    "Build practical understanding of LLMs, prompting, RAG, automation, complex agent-based experiences",
    "Help employees and decision-makers adopt AI in a secure, compliant, and trusted way that supports long-term scale.",
    "Learning modalities",
    "Virtual instructor-led training",
    "In-person classroom sessions",
    "Blended journeys combining training, workshops, and hands-on practice",
    "LEARNING AT SCALE",
    "Large AI programmes need more than training sessions. They need a scalable delivery model that keeps messaging, learning quality, and adoption measurement aligned across markets.",
    "Coordinate cohorts, localisation, and governance needs across regions without fragmenting the learning experience.",
    "Keep learning consistent across audiences while adapting examples, formats, and activation tactics to each context.",
    "Track adoption, engagement, and business impact through a shared measurement model that supports better steering decisions.",
    "ELEVATE ACADEMY",
    "Elevate Academy is Avenir Reply’s learning platform for AI enablement across geographies. It creates one consistent learning environment for role-based programmes, blended journeys, cohort management, and progress visibility. It supports:",
    "Centralised access to learning paths, materials, and enablement assets",
    "Centralised access to learning paths, materials, and enablement assets",
    "A consistent learner experience across markets and rollout waves",
    "A consistent learner experience across markets and rollout waves",
    "Progress tracking, completion data, and adoption metrics in one place",
    "Progress tracking, completion data, and adoption metrics in one place",
    "Integration of Microsoft courseware with Reply proprietary content",
    "Integration of Microsoft courseware with Reply proprietary content",
    "Support for blended and cohort-based learning models at enterprise scale",
    "Support for blended and cohort-based learning models at enterprise scale",
    "Our delivery model keeps the programme grounded in business priorities whilst building the structure needed for sustainable adoption.",
    "Understand business priorities, readiness levels, governance constraints, and where value can be unlocked first.",
    "Define audiences, target behaviours, learning architecture, and KPI logic for the programme.",
    "Deliver training, workshops, hands-on practice, communications, and activation assets that support real usage.",
    "Track engagement, adoption signals, feedback, and business impact indicators to steer the rollout with evidence.",
    "Refine the model, extend to new teams or countries, and expand into more advanced AI scenarios over time.",
    "WHY REPLY",
    "This is more than a training offer. It is an end-to-end enablement model designed to build skills, accelerate adoption, embed Responsible AI, and create measurable value from Microsoft Copilot and adjacent AI capabilities.",
    "Learning, consulting, and change management work together in one coordinated programme, so adoption does not stall between workstreams.",
    "We design journeys for business users, leaders, and IT teams, grounded in how people work, decide, and govern.",
    "Instructor-led, classroom, and blended formats can be combined to support global rollouts without losing consistency.",
    "Microsoft courseware can be tailored and enriched with Reply methodologies, workshops, and proprietary assets to fit each context.",
    "Trust, data awareness, and governance guardrails are embedded from the start to support secure and confident adoption.",
    "With Elevate Academy and a shared measurement model, organisations gain clearer visibility into engagement, adoption, and business impact.",
    "Let’s design a Copilot and AI learning journey that fits your workforce, governance model, and transformation priorities."
  ],
